:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Dealer Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-marlow-introduction'>>
	<<if _nam is 'Marlow'>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>The dealer wears a <span class='grey'>black waistcoat</span> over a white shirt, the sleeves turned back from the wrists. A few strands of neatly combed black hair hang above grey eyes. Those eyes follow a player's hands while the cards pass smoothly from one hand to the other. "Marlow," the dealer says, catching you watching. "If you're waiting for me to drop one, find a chair."
			<<option 'CN'>>荷官的白衬衫外套着一件<span class='grey'>黑色马甲</span>，袖口挽在手腕上方。梳得整齐的黑发垂下几缕，落在灰色眼睛上方。纸牌顺畅地在两手间交替，那双眼睛却留意着一名玩家的手。荷官发现你在看，开口说道：“马洛。要是等着看我掉牌，找把椅子吧。”
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>Marlow taps the rules card. "We play for chips here. Check the stakes before you sit down. No arguing over them afterwards."
			<<option 'CN'>>马洛敲了敲桌上的说明牌。“这里用筹码下注，入座前先看清赌注。别等打完才来争论。”
		<</language>><br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Dealer []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-casino-dealer'>>
<<set _casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
<<if _casino.available>>
	<<npc 'Marlow'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			<<if C.npc.Marlow.rage gte 10>>
				Marlow keeps the deck out of your reach. "You can play by the rules. But <span class='red'>I'm not putting you in charge of a table</span>."
			<<elseif C.npc.Marlow.rage gt 0>>
				Marlow leaves a hand on the deck. "What do you need? <span class='purple'>Keep your hands off the cards</span> until it's your turn."
			<<elseif _casino.state.good_shifts gte 5>>
				Marlow puts the deck down when you approach. "Good to see you. Here to play, or taking a shift?"
			<<elseif _casino.state.trained>>
				Marlow finishes counting a stack of chips. "Back again? There's a table you can take if you want a shift."
			<<elseif C.npc.Marlow.love gte 10>>
				Marlow notices you beside the table and nods. "Playing tonight? Or just having a look?"
			<<else>>
				Marlow pays out the winning hand, then turns to you. "Need something? I can explain the tables, or show you the work if you're interested."
			<</if>>
		<<option 'CN'>>
			<<if C.npc.Marlow.rage gte 10>>
				马洛把牌留在你够不着的地方。“按规矩玩可以。但<span class='red'>我不会让你照看牌桌</span>。”
			<<elseif C.npc.Marlow.rage gt 0>>
				马洛把手留在牌堆上。“有什么事？没轮到你，就<span class='purple'>别碰桌上的牌</span>。”
			<<elseif _casino.state.good_shifts gte 5>>
				见你过来，马洛放下牌。“你来了。今晚来玩，还是接个班？”
			<<elseif _casino.state.trained>>
				马洛数完一摞筹码。“又来了？想接班的话，有张桌子需要人照看。”
			<<elseif C.npc.Marlow.love gte 10>>
				马洛看见你站在桌旁，点了点头。“今晚玩牌吗？还是随便看看？”
			<<else>>
				马洛把筹码推给赢家，才转向你。“有什么事？不懂牌桌的规矩可以问我。想找工作，我也可以教你。”
			<</if>>
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<if _casino.canTalk>>
		<<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Have a word with Marlow', '和马洛聊聊'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Marlow Talk'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<<elseif _casino.state.last_chat_night is _casino.state.guest_night>>
		<<if _casino.state.chat_topic and !_casino.state.chat_reply>>
			<<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Finish your conversation', '继续刚才的谈话'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Marlow Conversation'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>Marlow nods to you, then turns back to the next customer.
				<<option 'CN'>>马洛朝你点了点头，又去招呼下一位客人。
			<</language>><br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if !_casino.state.trained>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				"I'll show you what to do for the first hour. You get <span class='gold'>£10</span> while you learn. After that, it's <span class='gold'>£30</span> an hour, with another <span class='gold'>£10</span> if you don't make any mistakes." Marlow puts a deck of cards at an empty seat.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				“头一个小时，我会教你怎么做，给你 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。学会以后，每小时底薪 <span class='gold'>£30</span>，没有出错，再加 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。”马洛把一副牌放在空位前。
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<if _casino.canWork>>
			<<icon 'casino/dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Take the training shift (1:00)', '跟马洛学做荷官 (1:00)']>>
				<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.canWork and !$LifeSimulation.casino.trained>>
					<<set $LifeSimulation.casino.trained to true>><<money 1000>><<tiredness 4>><<stress 2>><<pass 60>>
					<<if $passage is 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Dealer'>>
					  <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Training'>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<</lanLink>><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				"<span class='gold'>£30</span> an hour. Another <span class='gold'>£10</span> for a table kept in order. Miscounts come out of the bonus, not your pocket." Marlow points to the places waiting to be filled. "Finish any hand you're playing before you clock in."
			<<option 'CN'>>
				“每小时 <span class='gold'>£30</span>。牌桌照看得妥当，再加 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。点错筹码扣奖金，不让你倒贴。”马洛指了指空着的位置。“先结束你自己正在玩的牌局，再来接班。”
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<if _casino.canWork>>
			<<icon 'casino/dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Take a shift (1:00)', '接一个班次 (1:00)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work'>>
				<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.work_scenario is null>>
				  <<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.beginWork()>>
				<</if>>
			<</lanLink>><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if !_casino.canWork>>
		<<deadwood-casino-work-block>><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<deadwood-casino-work-block>><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-marlow-bribe>>
<</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Training []
<<nobr>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'deadwood_casino'>><<effects>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Marlow lets you practise with a deck before putting you at a quiet table. You catch a card with your finger while dealing. Marlow stops you and demonstrates again. You learn to set discarded cards aside, announce the bets, and keep the chips where everyone can see them.<br><br>
		At the end of the hour, Marlow hands you <span class='gold'>£10</span>. "<span class='green'>Come back for a regular shift next time</span>. If you're unsure who wins, ask before you hand over the pot."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		马洛先让你拿一副牌练习，再带你到一张客人不多的牌桌旁。发牌时，你的手指勾住了牌角。马洛叫你停下，又示范了一次。你学会了把弃牌放到一旁，报出赌注，让所有人都能看清桌上的筹码。<br><br>
		一小时结束后，马洛把 <span class='gold'>£10</span> 交给你。“<span class='green'>下次就可以来上班了</span>。不确定谁赢，先问我，再把筹码交出去。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
<<if _casino.canWork and _casino.state.work_scenario isnot null>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You take your place at the table. You spend most of the shift counting chips, shuffling and dealing. Marlow watches from the next table and comes over when the players get too loud. A guest questions a ruling. The others turn to you, waiting for an answer.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你站到牌桌前，开始数筹码、洗牌和发牌。马洛在隔壁牌桌留意着你，客人的声音太大时，就过来看看。一名客人对牌局的判定提出异议。其他人看向你，等着你的答复。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<switch _casino.state.work_scenario>>
		<<case 0>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					One player has £20 in front of them. The next raises the total to £60. The first points at their chips. "How much more do I owe?"
				<<option 'CN'>>
					一个客人已在面前放了 £20。下一位把总注额加到 £60。前者指着自己的筹码。“我还要补多少？”
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['£40', '£40']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['£60', '£60']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
		<<case 1>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					One player is all-in for £50. Two others have put in £100 each. The short stack wins the best hand and reaches for all £250.
				<<option 'CN'>>
					一位客人把仅剩的 £50 全部下注，另外两人各投入 £100。筹码较少的客人牌最好，伸手要拿走底池里的全部 £250。
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['Pay all £250 to the best hand', '把 £250 全付给最强手牌']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['Award the £150 main pot; settle the £100 side pot separately', '先判定 £150 主池，另外结算 £100 边池']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
		<<case 2>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					The five community cards form a royal flush. Neither player's private cards improve it. One insists that their pair of queens should win.
				<<option 'CN'>>
					五张公共牌已经组成皇家同花顺，两人的底牌都无法让它更强。其中一人坚称自己的一对 Q 应当赢。
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['Split the pot', '平分底池']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['Award the pot to the pair of queens', '把底池判给一对 Q']>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
	<</switch>>
<<else>>
	<<if _casino.workBlock>>
		<<deadwood-casino-work-block>><br>
	<<else>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>You have not taken a shift. Speak to Marlow first.
			<<option 'CN'>>你还没有接班。先去找马洛安排吧。
		<</language>><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step away without taking the shift', '不接班，退到一旁'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<set $LifeSimulation.casino.work_scenario to null>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-work-block'>>
	<<set $_casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
	<<switch $_casino.workBlock>>
		<<case 'trust'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>"An honest mistake I can correct," Marlow says. "Cheating is different. <span class='red'>I need to trust you before you deal for me again.</span>"
				<<option 'CN'>>“点错筹码，我可以帮你纠正。”马洛说。“故意作弊是另一回事。<span class='red'>我得能信得过你，才能再让你发牌。</span>”
			<</language>>
		<<case 'bribe'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>Marlow rests a hand on the deck. "I said you could sit down. I didn't say you could deal. <span class='blue'>No shifts for you tonight.</span>"
				<<option 'CN'>>马洛把手按在牌堆上。“我说的是让你坐下来玩，可没说让你发牌。<span class='blue'>今晚不安排你的班次。</span>”
			<</language>>
		<<case 'late'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>Marlow checks the clock. "We close at four. <span class='blue'>No new shifts after 03:00.</span> Come back tomorrow evening."
				<<option 'CN'>>马洛看了看钟。“四点就关门了，<span class='blue'>三点起不再安排新班次</span>。明晚再来吧。”
			<</language>>
		<<case 'holdem' 'three_card' 'blackjack'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>Marlow glances towards your seat. "<span class='blue'>You're still in a hand.</span> Finish playing, or leave that table, before taking a shift."
				<<option 'CN'>>马洛朝你的座位看了一眼。“<span class='blue'>你的牌局还没结束</span>。先打完，或者离席，再来接班。”
			<</language>><br>
			<<if $_casino.workBlock is 'holdem'>>
				<<lanLink ["Return to your hold'em table", '返回德州扑克牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem'>><</lanLink>>
			<<elseif $_casino.workBlock is 'three_card'>>
				<<lanLink ['Return to your three-card table', '返回炸金花牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Three Card'>><</lanLink>>
			<<else>>
				<<lanLink ['Return to your blackjack table', '返回二十一点牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Blackjack'>><</lanLink>>
			<</if>>
		<<case 'bound'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>You <span class='purple'>need both hands free</span> to shuffle, deal and count the chips.
				<<option 'CN'>>洗牌、发牌和点筹码都需要<span class='purple'>双手能自由活动</span>。
			<</language>>
		<<case 'gag'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>The gag prevents you from <span class='purple'>calling the bets</span>. You need to remove it before taking a shift.
				<<option 'CN'>>口中的堵塞物让你无法<span class='purple'>报出赌注</span>。取下来后才能接班。
			<</language>>
		<<case 'tired'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>You <span class='purple'>struggle to keep your eyes open</span>. "Get some rest first," Marlow says. "I need you awake enough to count."
				<<option 'CN'>>你<span class='purple'>困得眼皮直打架</span>。“先去休息吧。”马洛说。“得清醒点，才能把筹码数清楚。”
			<</language>>
		<<case 'unavailable'>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					<<if !$_casino.open>>The casino is <span class='blue'>closed</span>. Shifts begin at <span class='gold'>18:00</span>.
					<<elseif $_casino.barred>>Marlow has <span class='red'>barred you for tonight</span>. You cannot take a shift either.
					<<elseif $id lte 0>>Marlow needs to see your <span class='blue'>ID</span> before arranging a shift.
					<<elseif $exposed gt 0>>You need to <span class='purple'>cover yourself</span> before Marlow will put you at a table.
					<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>You are <span class='purple'>too overwhelmed</span> to keep track of the cards. Calm down before taking a shift.
					<<else>>Marlow cannot arrange a shift right now.<</if>>
				<<option 'CN'>>
					<<if !$_casino.open>>赌馆已经<span class='blue'>关门</span>。<span class='gold'>18:00</span> 起可以来接班。
					<<elseif $_casino.barred>>马洛<span class='red'>今晚不准你再上牌桌</span>，也不会让你接班。
					<<elseif $id lte 0>>安排班次之前，马洛需要先看你的<span class='blue'>身份证</span>。
					<<elseif $exposed gt 0>>先<span class='purple'>遮好身体</span>，马洛才会让你照看牌桌。
					<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>你<span class='purple'>慌得无法集中注意力</span>。先缓一缓，再来接班吧。
					<<else>>马洛现在无法安排班次。<</if>>
			<</language>>
	<</switch>>
<</widget>>
<<widget 'deadwood-casino-work-pay'>>
	<<set $_wage to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.finishWork(_args[0])>>
	<<if $_wage gt 0>>
		<<money $_wage>><<tiredness 4>>
		<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct>>
			<<stress 2>><<set C.npc.Marlow.love to Math.clamp(C.npc.Marlow.love + 1, 0, 30)>>
		<<else>><<stress 6>><</if>>
		<<pass 60>>
		<<if $passage is 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work'>>
		  <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End []
<<nobr>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'deadwood_casino'>><<effects>>
<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct is true>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You explain the ruling and count the chips in front of the players. <span class='teal'>The guest accepts your answer</span>. Marlow checks the payout and lets you carry on. At the end of the hour, you receive <span class='gold'>£40</span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你解释了判定，当着客人的面数清筹码。<span class='teal'>对方接受了你的答复</span>。马洛核对过金额，让你继续发牌。一小时结束，你领到 <span class='gold'>£40</span>。
	<</language>><<glove 'Marlow'>><br><br>
<<elseif $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct is false>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Marlow stops you before you hand over the chips. "Wait. <span class='blue'>Check the bets and the hands again</span>." You correct the ruling in front of the players. Marlow stays beside you for the rest of the hour. You receive your base pay of <span class='gold'>£30</span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你还没把筹码交出去，马洛就拦住了你。“等等。<span class='blue'>再核对一下下注和手牌</span>。”你当着客人的面纠正了判定。余下的时间里，马洛一直站在你旁边。你领到底薪 <span class='gold'>£30</span>。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<else>><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		No shift has been completed.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		你还没有完成班次。
<</language>><br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Wren []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.wrenPresent>>
	<<npc 'Wren'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			<<if $wrenSeen?.includes('cards')>>
				"Found another card table, have you?" Wren asks with a grin.
			<<elseif $wrenSeen?.length>>
				"Didn't expect to see you here," Wren says, recognising you.
			<<else>>
				"New face." Wren looks you over once, a grin spreading.
			<</if>>
			 Wren rolls a chip between <<his>> fingers. "Go on, sit down. Or watch. You might learn something." Wren glances towards Marlow as the deck is shuffled, then turns back to the bets.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			<<if $wrenSeen?.includes('cards')>>
				“又找到一张牌桌，是吧？”伦恩咧嘴笑道。
			<<elseif $wrenSeen?.length>>
				“没想到会在这里遇见你。”伦恩认出你，开口道。
			<<else>>
				“生面孔。”伦恩上下看了你一眼，扬起笑容。
			<</if>>
			伦恩用两根手指把玩着一枚筹码。“来，坐下。看着也行，说不定能学点什么。”洗牌声响起时，伦恩朝马洛看了一眼，随后又去看桌上的赌注。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.statistics.wren_hands gt 0>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.statistics.wren_profit gt 0>>"You did alright at our table," Wren says. "Going to keep it, or give us a chance to get some back?" <<He>> slides a chair out with one foot.
				<<else>>Wren taps the empty seat. "Back for another? Don't sit down just because you think we owe you." The grin returns. "Sit down because you want to play."<</if>>
			<<option 'CN'>>
				<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.statistics.wren_profit gt 0>>“在我们这桌，赚得还不错嘛。”伦恩说。“打算拿走，还是给我们个捞回一点的机会？”<<He>>用脚把一张椅子推了出来。
				<<else>>伦恩敲了敲空位。“还来？可别想着我们欠你钱，才坐下来。”<<He>>又咧嘴笑了。“想玩，才坐。”<</if>>
		<</language>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<icon 'casino/poker-chips.png'>><<lanLink ["Join the hold'em table", '加入德州扑克'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Wren has already left. Another guest takes the empty seat.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		伦恩已经离开，另一个客人坐上了空位。
<</language>><br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Landry []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.landryPresent>>
	<<npc 'Landry'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
